Here is a JSON schema for a beta cruiser:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "Beta Cruiser",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The name of the beta cruiser"
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "A brief description of the beta cruiser"
    },
    "capacity": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "The capacity of the beta cruiser"
    },
    "speed": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "The speed of the beta cruiser"
    },
    "engines": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["gasoline", "electric"]
          },
          "power": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The power output of the engine"
          },
          "efficiency": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The efficiency of the engine"
          }
        },
        "required": ["type", "power", "efficiency"]
      }
    },
    "features": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "navigation": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Whether the beta cruiser has navigation features"
        },
        "communication": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Whether the beta cruiser has communication features"
        },
        "security": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Whether the beta cruiser has security features"
        }
      },
      "required": ["navigation", "communication", "security"]
    }
  },
  "required": ["name", "description", "capacity", "speed", "engines", "features"]
}
```

This schema includes the following properties:

- `name`: The name of the beta cruiser.
- `description`: A brief description of the beta cruiser.
- `capacity`: The capacity of the beta cruiser.
- `speed`: The speed of the beta cruiser.
- `engines`: An array of engine objects, each containing the type, power, and efficiency of the engine.
- `features`: An object containing navigation, communication

